{
  "slug": "claude-prompt-library",
  "name": "Claude Prompt Library",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Save, search, load and manage reusable prompts across projects. Build a personal prompt library that persists across sessions and works in any project.\n\nKey features:\n- Save prompts with description, category and tags via /prompt save\n- Load prompts instantly via /prompt:<name> autocomplete\n- Search by name, tag, category or content\n- Edit prompts in-place with automatic metadata sync\n- Cross-platform: bash (macOS/Linux) and PowerShell (Windows)\n- Persistent storage that survives plugin updates",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `prompt` (Manage a personal prompt library) and **1 hook**, `PostToolUse`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-prompt-library@claude-community` from `franmastromarino/claude-prompt-library`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin to save, search, load and manage reusable prompts across projects.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
